    <main class="pt-28 pb-20 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid opacity-40 -z-10"></div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-8 ring-1 ring-blue-200/60">✨ New in 2026</div>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Build modern web apps<br>with <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500">Go</span></h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">Dreego compiles .dreego templates into native Go code — zero runtime overhead, single binary deploy, SSR-first.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-16">
            <a href="/signup" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-slate-900 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors text-lg shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/20">Start building free</a>
            <a href="/docs" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-white text-slate-700 font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 transition-colors text-lg shadow-sm">Documentation →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="inline-block bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-0.5 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-900/20">
            <div class="bg-slate-950 rounded-2xl px-6 py-5 text-left">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400"></div>
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></div>
                    <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></div>
                </div>
                <code class="text-sm text-emerald-400 font-mono leading-relaxed">$ dreego new myapp<br>$ dreego generate &amp;&amp; go run .<br><span class="text-slate-500">→ Server listening on :8080</span></code>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <section id="features" class="py-24 bg-slate-50/50">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 text-center mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Why Dreego</p>
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-center mb-16 tracking-tight">Everything you need to ship fast</h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-slate-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
                <div class="bg-white p-8 group hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">⚡</div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Compile-Time</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">.dreego files become native Go code. No runtime template engine, no reflection, zero overhead.</p></div>
                <div class="bg-white p-8 group hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">📦</div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Single Binary</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">One file. Assets, templates, server — all compiled into a single deployable binary.</p></div>
                <div class="bg-white p-8 group hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">🎨</div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Components</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Reusable, typed, scoped — build your UI library with .dreego components.</p></div>
                <div class="bg-white p-8 group hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">🔒</div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Type-Safe</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Go catches errors at build time, not runtime. No stringly-typed anything.</p></div>
                <div class="bg-white p-8 group hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">🚀</div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">SSR-First</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Server-rendered HTML with auto XSS escaping. Fast, SEO-friendly, accessible.</p></div>
                <div class="bg-white p-8 group hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">🛠️</div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">CLI Tooling</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Scaffold, generate, format, build, deploy — everything from the terminal.</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

